    "summary": "Israel and the Philistines gather for war—The Philistine princes send David away.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Now the Philistines gathered together all their armies to Aphek: and the Israelites pitched by a fountain which is in Jezreel.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 105,
            "text": "OR spring."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
